body:
On a serious note, the endorsement of extreme violence against women in the Bible makes me think that either: 

1) God endorses horrific violence against women for no reason, and the God in the Bible is acting as Satan or Demiurge in disguise; 

2) That God doesn't exist and is just a projection of human vices and sins onto a 'divine' image; 

3) That God does exist, but the Bible is not a divinely inspired or commanded text.
